    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2031429644520665327",
      "url": "https://x.com/rocketresearchx/status/2031429644520665327",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/rocketresearchx/status/2031429644520665327",
      "text": "Seeing on CT that people are betting that the markets are severely underestimating the first and second order effects of the Iran conflict.\n\nSome seasoned traders are comparing it to when Covid started to hit the shores. Stock prices for airlines and travel companies (and overall stock market) were still relatively unscathed in the first month. Until it started to tank massively.\n\nIn any case, we must agree that economically , most countries are going through a silent depression. This energy price shock is likely just seeing the first inning. \n\nPeople have been finding new avenues to supplement their income . During Covid, Southeast Asia turned to axie infinity and $axs hit $40 Billion and its reward coin $slp also surged sky high.\n\nThis time around though, with AI putting people out of jobs but still creating an entirely gig-based economy , could we see $Kled actually taking the limelight ? \n\nKled is like $axs but instead pays out real cash ( instead of what axie did by paying out $slp ). Some rumors have been floated around that increased payouts for tasks or special preferences will be given to holders of $kled \n\nWon’t be surprised Kled pulls an axie-like move. If you actually check the traffic and app download stats you already see the early innings - Philippines and Malaysia-based users are leading the charts. \n\nKled founder already verified that top data contributors already earn around $7.000+ per month. Playing around with some guesstimate figures - just assume that serious, full time contributors can make $300-$400 per month, wouldn’t be surprised they will at least hold $1.000 -$2.000 in $kled if it means their income will get boosted.\n\nAt 200.000 users and growing globally, let’s assume 30% are active contributors . 60.000 users each holding $2.000 worth of $kled would mean $120.000.000 in buying pressure and it grows each day. \n\nWill leave the rest for your interpretation. It’s after all a penny stock. But they just raised another $5.500.000 \n\nEven if you don’t trust the current state of the markets, just check out the investor list and perhaps allocate some dust.",
